<link rel="preload" href="/fuentes/saira-semi-condensed-latin-600-normal.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin><link rel="preload" href="/fuentes/figtree-latin-400-normal.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin><style>{{> css_sitio 16=d}}</style></head>
<body>
{{> cabecera_en 1=f}}
<main id="inicio">
<section class="portada simple">
<div class="envoltura">
<div>
<h1>What&#x27;s new in ManaLab</h1>
<div class="hero-cta"><a class="boton prim" href="/#descargar" data-goatcounter-click="novedades-descarga" data-goatcounter-title="novedades-descarga-en"><svg viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 4v11m0 0-4.5-4.5M12 15l4.5-4.5M5 20h14"></path></svg><span>Download free</span></a></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="seccion" id="novedades">
<div class="envoltura">
<div class="cab-sec">
<div class="eti">New in 2.3</div>
<h2>Now for Arena and Magic Online</h2>
<p>Version 2.3 brings Magic Online to ManaLab, with hands, statistics, replays and overlay, and adds a few things for everyone.</p>
</div>
<div class="funciones">
<div class="funcion"><svg viewbox="0 0 24 24"><rect height="12" rx="2" width="18" x="3" y="4"></rect><path d="M8 20h8M12 16v4"></path><path d="M8 9h8M8 12h5"></path></svg>
<h3>Magic Online, logged on its own</h3>
<p>MTGO games are recorded with their hands, mulligans, play or draw and the opponent's deck, and the overlay works there too. Your deck takes the name you saved it with in Magic Online when the list matches exactly; otherwise it is named by its colors.</p>
<p><a class="enlace-man" href="/magic-online/">Everything ManaLab does for Magic Online →</a></p></div>
<div class="funcion"><svg viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 20h18M5 20l5-9 3 5 2-3 4 7"></path><circle cx="17" cy="6" r="2"></circle></svg>
<h3>Lands list in the overlay</h3>
<p>Hover over «Lands» in the overlay to open every land in your deck with its copies left and the chance of drawing it next. You can turn it off in Settings › Overlay › My panel.</p></div>
<div class="funcion"><svg viewbox="0 0 24 24"><rect height="11" rx="4" width="8" x="8" y="9"></rect><path d="M9 9a3 3 0 0 1 6 0M4 13h4M16 13h4M5 19l3-2M19 19l-3-2M5 7l3 2M19 7l-3 2"></path></svg>
<h3>Report a bug</h3>
<p>A «Report a bug» button inside the app lets you tell us what went wrong, with the latest lines of the log if you choose to attach them.</p></div>
<div class="funcion"><svg viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 20V11M10 20V4M16 20v-7M22 20H2"></path></svg>
<h3>Statistics by real format</h3>
<p>Each game counts in its real format, and you can filter the statistics by format.</p></div>
<div class="funcion"><svg viewbox="0 0 24 24"><rect height="16" rx="2" width="18" x="3" y="4"></rect><path d="M3 9h18M9 9v11"></path></svg>
<h3>Redesigned interface</h3>
<p>The whole app has a new look.</p></div>
<div class="funcion"><svg viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 4h10a3 3 0 0 1 3 3v13H8a3 3 0 0 1-3-3z"></path><path d="M9 8h5M9 12h5"></path></svg>
<h3>User manual in English</h3>
<p>A PDF manual that comes with every version.</p>
<p><a class="enlace-man" href="https://github.com/EusebioG96/ManaLab/releases/download/v2.3.0/ManaLab-manual-en.pdf" rel="noopener">Download the manual (PDF) →</a></p></div>
</div>
<div class="novedades mtgo-capturas">
<div class="novedad">
<div class="ventana"><picture><source srcset="../img/en_mtgo_panel.webp" type="image/webp"><img alt="ManaLab Dashboard with Arena listening and Magic Online in a game, reading mtgo.log, and the latest matches with an MTGO tag, shown with sample data" height="860" loading="lazy" src="../img/en_mtgo_panel.jpg" width="1366"/></picture></div>
<div><div class="eti">Dashboard</div>
<h3>Arena and Magic Online, side by side</h3>
<p>The Dashboard shows the state of each game and your latest matches, with a small MTGO tag on the ones you played in Magic Online.</p></div>
</div>
<div class="novedad">
<div class="ventana"><picture><source srcset="../img/en_mtgo_banquillo.webp" type="image/webp"><img alt="ManaLab sideboard notice over Magic Online between games: «Did you change your sideboard?» with the buttons «Use this change», «No changes» and «Edit», shown with sample data" height="440" loading="lazy" src="../img/en_mtgo_banquillo.jpg" width="1000"/></picture></div>
<div><div class="eti">Sideboard</div>
<h3>Confirm your sideboard in one click</h3>
<p>Magic Online doesn't send your sideboarded list in time, so between games a small panel asks whether you changed it: use last time's change, say there were none, or open the editor.</p></div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="mtgo-caja">
<h3>Magic Online in ManaLab: what is the same and what is different</h3>
<ul>
<li><b>Nothing to set up.</b> ManaLab starts recording by itself when you open Magic Online. You can also import an <code>mtgo.log</code> file to bring in games you played with ManaLab closed.</li>
<li><b>Your main tools, in Magic Online.</b> Hands, mulligans, play or draw, the opponent's deck, statistics, replay and overlay.</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="seccion franja" id="anteriores">
<div class="envoltura">
<div class="cab-sec">
<div class="eti">Earlier · Version 2.2</div>
<h2>Study your games and work with your coach</h2>
<p>Version 2.2 was about reviewing: replays, reports and trends.</p>
</div>
<div class="novedades">
<div class="novedad">
<div class="ventana"><picture><source srcset="../img/v22_repeticion.webp" type="image/webp"><img alt="Replay of a lost game in ManaLab, shown with Arena: board with real card images, a turn timeline and key moments" height="782" loading="lazy" src="../img/v22_repeticion.jpg" width="1041"/></picture></div>
<div><div class="eti">Replay</div>
<h3>Every game, replayed with the real cards</h3>
<p>A board with the real card images, key moments and your coach's comments pinned to each step. In Magic Online, phases and tapped cards are deduced and marked ≈.</p></div>
</div>
<div class="novedad">
<div class="ventana estrecha"><picture><source srcset="../img/v22_informe_sesion.webp" type="image/webp"><img alt="The «Session report» dialog in ManaLab, where you pick options for a single file with the chosen games" height="672" loading="lazy" src="../img/v22_informe_sesion.jpg" width="584"/></picture></div>
<div><div class="eti">Session report</div>
<h3>A session report for your coach</h3>
<p>Press «Prepare session» and pick the games: you get one file with hands, key moments and notes, to review or send to your coach.</p></div>
</div>
<div class="novedad">
<div class="ventana"><picture><source srcset="../img/v22_tendencias.webp" type="image/webp"><img alt="ManaLab Statistics table of the most repeated mistakes with percentage of games and trend over the last 30 days" height="432" loading="lazy" src="../img/v22_tendencias.jpg" width="1004"/></picture></div>
<div><div class="eti">Tags and trends</div>
<h3>Coach tags and trends</h3>
<p>Your coach tags mistakes per game or per step, and «What repeats the most» shows how each one evolves over 30 or 90 days, or your whole history.</p></div>
</div>
<div class="novedad">
<div class="ventana estrecha"><picture><source srcset="../img/v22_overlay.webp" type="image/webp"><img alt="Redesigned ManaLab overlay, shown over Arena, with card names, mana costs and the chance of drawing each card" height="820" loading="lazy" src="../img/v22_overlay.jpg" width="684"/></picture></div>
<div><div class="eti">Overlay</div>
<h3>A redesigned overlay</h3>
<p>New look, card names in your language and the chance of drawing each card in your next 1, 2 or 3 draws.</p></div>
</div>
</div>
<p class="pie-captura">Screenshots with sample data from Arena.</p>
</div>
</section>
</main>
{{> pie_en}}

<script defer="" src="/descarga.js"></script>
<script data-goatcounter="https://manalab.goatcounter.com/count" async src="//gc.zgo.at/count.js"></script></body>
